{"id":50724,"date":"2026-04-23T12:17:07","date_gmt":"2026-04-23T11:17:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50724"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:37:14","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:37:14","slug":"trail-hiper-activo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-hiper-activo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Hiper-Activo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Hiper-Activo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>II Trail Hiper-Activo 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partida e chegada no <strong>Parque Urbano da P\u00f3voa da Galega<\/strong>, na freguesia do Milharado, concelho de <strong>Mafra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Clube Hiper-Activo da Malveira<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Milharado<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Mafra<\/strong>, o evento visa a promo\u00e7\u00e3o do desporto em meio natural e a valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o das paisagens saloias.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o apresenta os percursos de <st